    "result_text": "I've made the change and `bin/e2e` passes, including the replay of earlier test data.\n\nWhen the invoice discount is split across lines and two lines have equal leftover fractions, the leftover cent now goes to the line with the larger amount. Only if the amounts are also equal does it go to the line with the lower id.\n\nThe fix was in `discountShares()` in `src/main/java/net/officefloor/hq/app/invoices/Invoice.java`. I added the larger-amount check to the order the leftover cents are handed out in, ahead of the lower-id check, and updated the method's comment to match. No front-end or data changes were needed, because the server works out the split and the UI just shows each line's share.",
